    "summary": {
      "value": "Strenghten attacks when you fight with weapon and shield."
    },
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> you must have mastered <strong>Commander</strong> or <strong>Guardian</strong>.</p><hr><p>As long as you have a <strong>weapon</strong> equipped in your <strong>main hand slot</strong> and a <strong>shield</strong> equipped in your <strong>off-hand slot</strong>, your attacks with that weapon deal 5 extra damage and you gain a +1 bonus to Defense.</p><p>This Skill <strong>cannot</strong> be combined with <strong>custom weapons</strong>, <strong>nor</strong> with the @UUID[Compendium.projectfu.skills.Item.aPQXTQegswRisA1R]{Dual Shieldbearer} Skill.</p>",
